    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was your last game too easy?</i> <strong>Phoenix 2</strong> turns up the heat\u2014it dares you to sharpen your reflexes, master its mechanics, and face down overwhelming odds. This is a game where <strong>skill matters</strong>, and only the best will survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix 2 is a <strong>fast-paced shoot 'em up</strong> where survival is about more than just dodging. Bullets and lasers flood the screen, but victory comes from <strong>mastering your ship\u2019s abilities</strong>. Blast through enemy waves, unleash devastating attacks, and turn impossible odds into a spectacle of destruction. <i>If you're overwhelmed, you're doing it wrong!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> your own fleet from <strong>100 unlockable ships</strong>, each armed with a unique main weapon and its own set of special abilities! Do you prefer evasion? Choose a ship with <strong>Teleport</strong> or <strong>Barrier</strong>. Need more firepower? Get the <strong>Mega Laser</strong> or <strong>Vorpal Lance</strong>\u2014or both! There's a ship for every playstyle. And when you have mastered one, reach perfection by getting its ultimate <strong>Apex Forms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>30 story missions</strong> that push you to the edge. Explore the far reaches of space, face unyielding enemy waves, and take down screen-filling bosses as you fight back against the Invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, <strong>new challenges drop every single day</strong>\u2014identical for every pilot worldwide. Choose your favourite ship, show your mastery of its abilities, and <strong>rise on the leaderboards</strong>. It\u2019s you against everyone else. In these <strong>global rankings</strong>, every fraction of a second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running on <strong>our handcrafted game engine</strong>, Phoenix 2 delivers ultra-fluid action with seamless cross-platform play. Run at the <strong>maximum FPS</strong> your system can deliver for ultra-fluid action and incredibly responsive controls. Play with <strong>mouse, keyboard, or gamepad</strong>, whichever suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy won\u2019t save itself. Are you ready to take flight?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/e6851ed974df8e0de5e2851b5a789873.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was your last game too easy?</i> <strong>Phoenix 2</strong> turns up the heat\u2014it dares you to sharpen your reflexes, master its mechanics, and face down overwhelming odds. This is a game where <strong>skill matters</strong>, and only the best will survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6e2b4e0764b5b3dddcd18a1dc73229f3.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix 2 is a <strong>fast-paced shoot 'em up</strong> where survival is about more than just dodging. Bullets and lasers flood the screen, but victory comes from <strong>mastering your ship\u2019s abilities</strong>. Blast through enemy waves, unleash devastating attacks, and turn impossible odds into a spectacle of destruction. <i>If you're overwhelmed, you're doing it wrong!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/02d2e4f6025cef288e8a642bd51d85f4.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> your own fleet from <strong>100 unlockable ships</strong>, each armed with a unique main weapon and its own set of special abilities! Do you prefer evasion? Choose a ship with <strong>Teleport</strong> or <strong>Barrier</strong>. Need more firepower? Get the <strong>Mega Laser</strong> or <strong>Vorpal Lance</strong>\u2014or both! There's a ship for every playstyle. And when you have mastered one, reach perfection by getting its ultimate <strong>Apex Forms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/6988245283aa9ab8a76afd1059a300a8.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>30 story missions</strong> that push you to the edge. Explore the far reaches of space, face unyielding enemy waves, and take down screen-filling bosses as you fight back against the Invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/538fe5a791279749eba3e0727cdd712a.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, <strong>new challenges drop every single day</strong>\u2014identical for every pilot worldwide. Choose your favourite ship, show your mastery of its abilities, and <strong>rise on the leaderboards</strong>. It\u2019s you against everyone else. In these <strong>global rankings</strong>, every fraction of a second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.poster.avif?t=1742309360\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.webm?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/1257e36825391b3245eff22748ecd96a.mp4?t=1742309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running on <strong>our handcrafted game engine</strong>, Phoenix 2 delivers ultra-fluid action with seamless cross-platform play. Run at the <strong>maximum FPS</strong> your system can deliver for ultra-fluid action and incredibly responsive controls. Play with <strong>mouse, keyboard, or gamepad</strong>, whichever suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy won\u2019t save itself. Are you ready to take flight?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
